    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 8,
    "title": "Extend disposal clauses",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-ba-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Extend disposal clauses",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A 把 predicate must say what happens to an identifiable object. It may include repetition, aspect or a duration/count; put negation and other adverbials before 把. A duration after the action can specify how long the affected object was used, without replacing the event-count construction.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你把书看看。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ bǎ shū kàn kàn 。",
                "meaning": "Take a look at the book.",
                "audio": "3dca35e90894b9d7b6288764b74d7835a7d998b48bf5cbccec2cadc77b2a5a61"
              },
              {
                "text": "我把门关了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bǎ mén guān le 。",
                "meaning": "I closed the door.",
                "audio": "11f632a2b846ce2d57d2e7030c6840db17036510328983ab1adff619527506b0"
              },
              {
                "text": "他把这本书看了三次。",
                "pinyin": "tā bǎ zhè běn shū kàn le sān cì 。",
                "meaning": "He read this book three times.",
                "audio": "1feba221aaba5c848e2d45475e9ef6d20d848a946f0a4ff42edc64c5770bd943"
              },
              {
                "text": "我没把书拿走。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ méi bǎ shū ná zǒu 。",
                "meaning": "I did not take the book away.",
                "audio": "eb371757ccbfb6275b2ca10805aaa29c54bd42dc43c1ba5bf396b362607a5dca"
              },
              {
                "text": "我把这本书看了三天。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bǎ zhè běn shū kàn le sān tiān 。",
                "meaning": "I spent three days reading this book.",
                "audio": "38a007f620d7d28a8bae029d5f00a93adea1285226ebf351a5c50b92dd3bc8b2"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
